THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------
The Windows build bundles third-party Python packages (Streamlit, pandas,
numpy, pyarrow, yfinance, plotly, and others). Their licenses are included
under `_internal/*.dist-info/` in the shipped folder and are summarized in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt when that file is generated at build time.
